Defense Evasion – Disabling Windows Event Log Service
1. Case Overview

Case Name: Defense Evasion by Disabling Event Log Service
Category: Defense Evasion
MITRE ATT&CK Technique: T1562.001 – Impair Defenses: Disable or Modify Tools
Target: Windows Event Log Service

2. Investigation Objective

The objective of this investigation was to identify activity related to disabling a Windows service and determine whether the Windows Event Log service was targeted.

3. Investigation

Since the case was related to disabling a service, the investigation was started by searching the logs using the keyword:

disable

